+### Per-game compatibility profiles (cpp23)
+
+The canonical launcher now creates an isolated workspace for every detected disc title:
+
+```text
+games\<TITLE>\game.cfg
+games\<TITLE>\generated\
+games\<TITLE>\build\
+```
+
